  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assisted Voluntary Return of Third-Country Nationals on the Basis of Italian Law N.943 of 30 Dec 1986 (Social Security Agency - INPS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to assist regular workers who have worked and contributed for at least one quarter (three months period) to the Italian social security agency (INPS) contribution scheme and wish to return home. It also assists deceased regular migrant regular migrant workers whose community requests their return to the home country.</narrative>
  </description>
